                                        "entry_id": "d45a3649-1337-3308-b2f4-3a3856312346",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gender-critical or trans-exclusionary feminist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "414763e4-c1f6-43ee-bc16-7ee0183de2c0",
                                                "sense_id": "c6009a30-8e41-39be-826d-a2a8d215b77d",
                                                "text": "Gendercritters never begin by being critical of their own gender stereotypes. It’s almost as if they think it’s everyone else’s job to free them from their stereotype performances."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1d540d3-4d18-4d8c-8331-caf4028c983f",
                                                "sense_id": "c6009a30-8e41-39be-826d-a2a8d215b77d",
                                                "text": "Also, from the way they talk about non-passing trans women I suspect most gendercritters are only OK with GNC men so long as they fit a highly specific mould of thin, white, youthful androgyny."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1f2ac83-3d70-4780-bd63-7f172048aa49",
                                                "sense_id": "c6009a30-8e41-39be-826d-a2a8d215b77d",
                                                "text": "Have gendercritters tried blaming coronavirus on trans people yet?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
